<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ADAS_NET<sp/>--&gt;<sp/>PROJ[&quot;ProjectionEngine<sp/>(Ray-Plane<sp/>Intersection)&quot;]</highlight></codeline>
