<codeline><highlight class="normal">####<sp/>Blueprint<sp/>for<sp/>Future<sp/>Implementation:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">1.<sp/>**Interface<sp/>Contract**:<sp/>Define<sp/>an<sp/>abstract<sp/>`IGazeDirectionEstimator`<sp/>with:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```cpp</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>virtual<sp/>bool<sp/>estimate_gaze(const<sp/>GazeFrameData&amp;<sp/>frame,<sp/>Vector3&amp;<sp/>out_gaze_dir)<sp/>=<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">2.<sp/>**Implementation<sp/>Strategy**:</highlight></codeline>
